    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">YOUNG MEN&apos;S CHRISTIAN ASSOCIATION<lb/>of
                        the City of <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__773" type="place">Newark</rs>, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__867" type="place">New Jersey</rs><lb/>107-11
                        Halsey Street – Telephone Market 3-0101</fw><dateline><date
                            when="1945-11-19">November 19, 1945</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>I am very sorry that the treasurer forgot to sign your check. I mailed it to <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__774" type="place">Atlantic City</rs> to have it
                    signed and it will be returned to you directly.</p>
                <p>Thank you for coming to <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__775" type="place"
                        >Trenton</rs>. Your address was very thought provoking, and I have heard
                    very enthusiastic remarks about it.</p>
                <p>Please get in touch with me if this check should not come back to you within a
                    few days.</p>
                <closer><salute>Cordially yours,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3343"
                            type="person">Johannes Nabholz</rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
